{"page":280,"verses":[{"verse_key":"16:111","surah":16,"ayah":111,"ar_uthmani":"۞ يَوْمَ تَأْتِى كُلُّ نَفْسٍ تُجَـٰدِلُ عَن نَّفْسِهَا وَتُوَفَّىٰ كُلُّ نَفْسٍ مَّا عَمِلَتْ وَهُمْ لَا يُظْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On the Day when every soul will come pleading for itself, every soul will be paid in full for all its actions- they will not be wronged.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(On) the Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَأْتِى","en_gloss":"(when) will come","transliteration":"tatī","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كُلُّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kullu","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَفْسٍۢ","en_gloss":"soul","transliteration":"nafsin","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تُجَـٰدِلُ","en_gloss":"pleading","transliteration":"tujādilu","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نَّفْسِهَا","en_gloss":"itself","transliteration":"nafsihā","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَتُوَفَّىٰ","en_gloss":"and will be paid in full","transliteration":"watuwaffā","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كُلُّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kullu","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":10,"ar":"نَفْسٍۢ","en_gloss":"soul","transliteration":"nafsin","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَمِلَتْ","en_gloss":"it did","transliteration":"ʿamilat","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(will) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يُظْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"be wronged","transliteration":"yuẓ'lamūna","verse_key":"16:111"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١١١","en_gloss":"(111)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:111"}]},{"verse_key":"16:112","surah":16,"ayah":112,"ar_uthmani":"وَضَرَبَ ٱللَّهُ مَثَلًا قَرْيَةً كَانَتْ ءَامِنَةً مُّطْمَئِنَّةً يَأْتِيهَا رِزْقُهَا رَغَدًا مِّن كُلِّ مَكَانٍ فَكَفَرَتْ بِأَنْعُمِ ٱللَّهِ فَأَذَٰقَهَا ٱللَّهُ لِبَاسَ ٱلْجُوعِ وَٱلْخَوْفِ بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَصْنَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God presents the example of a town that was secure and at ease, with provisions coming to it abundantly from all places. Then it became ungrateful for God’s blessings, so God afflicted it with the garment of famine and fear, for what its people had done.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَضَرَبَ","en_gloss":"And Allah sets forth","transliteration":"waḍaraba","verse_key":"16:112"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah sets forth","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"16:112"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَثَلًۭا","en_gloss":"a similitude","transliteration":"mathalan","verse_key":"16:112"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَرْيَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(of) a town","transliteration":"qaryatan","verse_key":"16:112"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَانَتْ","en_gloss":"(that) was","transliteration":"kānat","verse_key":"16:112"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ءَامِنَةًۭ","en_gloss":"secure","transliteration":"āminatan","verse_key":"16:112"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُّطْمَئِنَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"and content","transliteration":"muṭ'ma-innatan","verse_key":"16:112"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَأْتِيهَا","en_gloss":"coming to it","transliteration":"yatīhā","verse_key":"16:112"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رِزْقُهَا","en_gloss":"its provision","transliteration":"riz'quhā","verse_key":"16:112"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَغَدًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) abundance","transliteration":"raghadan","verse_key":"16:112"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:112"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"16:112"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَكَانٍۢ","en_gloss":"place","transliteration":"makānin","verse_key":"16:112"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فَكَفَرَتْ","en_gloss":"but it denied","transliteration":"fakafarat","verse_key":"16:112"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِأَنْعُمِ","en_gloss":"(the) Favors of Allah","transliteration":"bi-anʿumi","verse_key":"16:112"},{"