"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابُ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu","verse_key":"16:113"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"while they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"16:113"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ظَـٰلِمُونَ","en_gloss":"(were) wrongdoers","transliteration":"ẓālimūna","verse_key":"16:113"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١١٣","en_gloss":"(113)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:113"}]},{"verse_key":"16:114","surah":16,"ayah":114,"ar_uthmani":"فَكُلُوا۟ مِمَّا رَزَقَكُمُ ٱللَّهُ حَلَـٰلًا طَيِّبًا وَٱشْكُرُوا۟ نِعْمَتَ ٱللَّهِ إِن كُنتُمْ إِيَّاهُ تَعْبُدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So eat of the good and lawful things God has provided for you and be thankful for His blessings, if it is Him that you worship.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَكُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"So eat","transliteration":"fakulū","verse_key":"16:114"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِمَّا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"16:114"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَزَقَكُمُ","en_gloss":"Allah has provided you ","transliteration":"razaqakumu","verse_key":"16:114"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has provided you ","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"16:114"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَلَـٰلًۭا","en_gloss":"lawful","transliteration":"ḥalālan","verse_key":"16:114"},{"pos":6,"ar":"طَيِّبًۭا","en_gloss":"and good","transliteration":"ṭayyiban","verse_key":"16:114"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱشْكُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"And be grateful","transliteration":"wa-ush'kurū","verse_key":"16:114"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نِعْمَتَ","en_gloss":"(for the) Favor","transliteration":"niʿ'mata","verse_key":"16:114"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"16:114"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"16:114"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"[you]","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"16:114"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِيَّاهُ","en_gloss":"Him Alone","transliteration":"iyyāhu","verse_key":"16:114"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَعْبُدُونَ","en_gloss":"you worship","transliteration":"taʿbudūna","verse_key":"16:114"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١١٤","en_gloss":"(114)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:114"}]},{"verse_key":"16:115","surah":16,"ayah":115,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا حَرَّمَ عَلَيْكُمُ ٱلْمَيْتَةَ وَٱلدَّمَ وَلَحْمَ ٱلْخِنزِيرِ وَمَآ أُهِلَّ لِغَيْرِ ٱللَّهِ بِهِۦ ۖ فَمَنِ ٱضْطُرَّ غَيْرَ بَاغٍ وَلَا عَادٍ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He has forbidden you only these things: carrion, blood, pig’s meat, and animals over which any name other than God’s has been invoked. But if anyone is forced by hunger, not desiring it nor exceeding their immediate need, God is forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"16:115"},{"pos":2,"ar":"حَرَّمَ","en_gloss":"He has forbidden","transliteration":"ḥarrama","verse_key":"16:115"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمُ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ʿalaykumu","verse_key":"16:115"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمَيْتَةَ","en_gloss":"the dead animal","transliteration":"l-maytata","verse_key":"16:115"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلدَّمَ","en_gloss":"and the blood","transliteration":"wal-dama","verse_key":"16:115"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَحْمَ","en_gloss":"and the flesh","transliteration":"walaḥma","verse_key":"16:115"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْخِنزِيرِ","en_gloss":"(of) the swine","transliteration":"l-khinzīri","verse_key":"16:115"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"16:115"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أُهِلَّ","en_gloss":"has been dedicated","transliteration":"uhilla","verse_key":"16:115"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِغَيْرِ","en_gloss":"to other (than)","transliteration":"lighayri","verse_key":"16:115"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"16:115"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"[with it]","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"16:115"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَمَنِ","en_gloss":"But (if) one","transliteration":"famani","verse_key":"16:115"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱضْطُرَّ","en_gloss